[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 22860.23, "timestamp": "06:21:00", "text": "10個は多すぎるかもしれない。 100秒。うん、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22863.59, "timestamp": "06:21:03", "text": "これが私の望みだ。私と私、私は思う"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22868.07, "timestamp": "06:21:08", "text": "私ができることは楕円形を配置することです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22870.27, "timestamp": "06:21:10", "text": "である"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22874.51, "timestamp": "06:21:14", "text": "これ。いいえ、箱の下に置かなければなりません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22879.31, "timestamp": "06:21:19", "text": "右？箱を作る。内部"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22881.91, "timestamp": "06:21:21", "text": "箱。いや、待って。ボックスにはさらに"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22883.33, "timestamp": "06:21:23", "text": "アニメーション化はしているが。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22884.59, "timestamp": "06:21:24", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22888.99, "timestamp": "06:21:28", "text": "えっと、それを中に入れることができます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22891.708, "timestamp": "06:21:31", "text": "箱ですよね？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22896.75, "timestamp": "06:21:36", "text": "それから箱の中で、私ができること"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22900.39, "timestamp": "06:21:40", "text": "それを凝縮する。いや、違う。待って。それは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22903.31, "timestamp": "06:21:43", "text": "それが私のすべきことなの？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22907.31, "timestamp": "06:21:47", "text": "する？ Oを隠す"}]